Fetch every followed feed, or the given ones, and archive each item the
archive does not hold yet. Unchanged feeds are not downloaded again. A feed
that fails is reported and the others still sync.

Usage:
  msgvault source feeds sync [url]... [flags]

Examples:
  msgvault source feeds sync
  msgvault source feeds sync https://example.com/releases.atom

Flags:
      --build-cache      refresh analytics cache after this sync
      --full             download every feed again, even when unchanged
  -h, --help             help for sync
      --no-build-cache   skip analytics cache refresh after this sync

Global Flags: --agent-allow-insecure, --agent-token-file, --agent-url, --config, --home, --local, --log-file, --log-level, --log-sql, --log-sql-slow-ms, --no-log-file, -v/--verbose (see 'msgvault --help')
